<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      a {
        color: #007bff;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Hello <%= approverName %>,</p>
    <p>
      This is a confirmation that you have disapproved the document titled
      <strong>"<%= documentName %>"</strong>.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Document Details:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Title:</strong> <%= documentName %></li>
      <li><strong>Submitted By:</strong> <%= userName %></li>
      <li><strong>Submission Date:</strong> <%= submissionDate %></li>
      <li>
        <strong>Reason for Disapproval (if provided):</strong> <%=
        disapprovalReason %>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      If you need to take further action, please contact the document creator
      directly at <%= userEmail %>.
    </p>

    <p>Thank you for your feedback and attention to the review process.</p>

    <p>Best regards,</p>
    <p><%= companyName %> Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
